/span><span begin="01:19.490" end="01:20.150">already </span><span begin="01:20.150" end="01:22.070">broken</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.310" end="01:26.540"><span begin="01:22.310" end="01:22.490">I </span><span begin="01:22.490" end="01:22.940">told </span><span begin="01:22.940" end="01:23.510">myself </span><span begin="01:23.510" end="01:23.760">that </span><span begin="01:23.760" end="01:23.850">it </span><span begin="01:23.850" end="01:24.380">wouldn't </span><span begin="01:24.380" end="01:24.530">be </span><span begin="01:24.530" end="01:24.890">so </span><span begin="01:24.890" end="01:26.540">bad</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.720" end="01:30.980"><span begin="01:26.720" end="01:26.930">But </span><span begin="01:26.930" end="01:27.380">pulling </span><span begin="01:27.380" end="01:27.890">away </span><span begin="01:27.890" end="01:28.040">you </span><span begin="01:28.040" end="01:28.370">took </span><span begin="01:28.370" end="01:29.120">everything </span><span begin="01:29.120" end="01:29.390">I </span><span begin="01:29.390" end="01:30.980">had</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.550" end="01:37.160"><span begin="01:31.550" end="01:32.000">You </span><span begin="01:32.000" end="01:32.480">tried </span><span begin="01:32.480" end="01:32.660">to </span><span begin="01:32.660" end="01:33.260">lie </span><span begin="01:33.260" end="01:33.380">and </span><span begin="01:33.380" end="01:33.830">say </span><span begin="01:33.830" end="01:33.980">I </span><span begin="01:33.980" end="01:34.400">was </span><span begin="01:34.400" end="01:37.160">everything</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.430" end="01:42.860"><span begin="01:37.430" end="01:37.670">I </span><span begin="01:37.670" end="01:38.690">remember </span><span begin="01:38.690" end="01:39.020">when </span><span begin="01:39.020" end="01:39.170">I </span><span begin="01:39.170" end="01:39.860">said </span><span begin="01:39.860" end="01:40.160">I'm </span><span be